# Regression guard for black rounds.
# A stale post_round_advanced flag used to start every second round BEHIND A CLOSED CURTAIN
# (rounds 3, 5... entirely black). This capture freezes round 3 in mid-game: if the bug
# comes back the image is ~100% black, so the hash changes.
# Run with: cargo run -p crackattack-webgpu -- --preset vs-computer hard \
#             --set session:game.seed=42 --set session:autoplay=true \
#             --script qa/scripts/shader-vs-ia-round3.mini   (or qa/run-baseline.sh)
@5590 assert flow=playing
@5600 capture round3-visible   # round 3 in progress (0-2 at seed 42); it used to be black
@5660 quit
